Package: GeneTrackR
Type: Package
Title: Genomic Track Visualization and Haplotype Analysis
Version: 0.8.2
Authors@R: person("Rensc", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "rensc0718@163.com")
Description: Provides tools to read, validate, query, transform, write,
    and visualize gene annotations, genomic signal tracks, and variant
    tracks using a shared genomic coordinate framework. Supports GenePred,
    GTF, GFF3, and BED annotations; bedGraph, wig, and bigWig signals; VCF
    variants; integrated locus visualization; haplotype construction;
    phenotype association; linkage disequilibrium; haplotype refinement;
    and variant-effect analysis. The package interoperates with
    GenomicRanges objects and uses a pure-R signal I/O layer so core
    workflows do not require a compiled extension.
License: GPL + file LICENSE
